  "solution": "Ta có các góc <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>O</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>O</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mi>O</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mi>…</mi></mrow></semantics></math> đều bằng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msup><mn>45</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></semantics></math>. Ta có:\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>O</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>O</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mo>cos</mo><msup><mn>45</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>O</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>O</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mo>cos</mo><msup><mn>45</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>;</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>O</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>O</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mo>cos</mo><msup><mn>45</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>;</mo><mi>…</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tVậy độ dài các đoạn thẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>…</mi></mrow></semantics></math> tạo thành cấp số nhân lùi vô hạn với số hạng đầu bằng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></semantics></math> và công bội bằng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac></semantics></math>. Do đó, độ đài đường gấp khúc <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mi>…</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>",
